[
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1K2M8Q3H7V6D0R2P5A9C",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 16,
    "text": "For God so loved the world, that he gave his one and only Son, that whoever believes in him should not perish, but have eternal life.",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:18:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-03T21:44:11Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1M7Q6D2R9H1K8V3P0C5N",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 17,
    "text": "For God didn’t send his Son into the world to judge the world, but that the world should be saved through him.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:19:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-28T10:07:19Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1P4V8C1M6D2R7T9H0K3",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 18,
    "text": "He who believes in him is not judged. He who doesn’t believe has been judged already, because he has not believed in the name of God’s only Son.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:21:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-10T06:12:48Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1S9N4V6C2M8D0R3H7K1",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 19,
    "text": "This is the judgment, that the light has come into the world, and men loved the darkness rather than the light; for their works were evil.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:22:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-22T19:05:33Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1V5R0P8V3H6D2M9C1K7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 20,
    "text": "For everyone who does evil hates the light, and doesn’t come to the light, lest his works would be exposed.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:23:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-18T14:39:07Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T1Y2D6H9K3M8R0T5V1P7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KZ2H8M3Q1R7V9C5N0L6P4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F2K9M3D8Q6H4V0T2R5A",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 21,
    "text": "But he who does the truth comes to the light, that his works may be revealed, that they have been done in God.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-14T09:24:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-03T21:44:11Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T20C9T4L6D0R2H8Q1V5W",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 1,
    "text": "Yahweh is my shepherd: I shall lack nothing.",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:52:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-12T08:37:54Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T22P8S4H6K0V2C9M1R7T",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 2,
    "text": "He makes me lie down in green pastures. He leads me beside still waters.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:53:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-19T11:06:40Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T24W1Q9D2H7M5A8K0V3R",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 3,
    "text": "He restores my soul. He guides me in the paths of righteousness for his name’s sake.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:55:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-01T07:21:59Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T27K7N3A5V8P1C6H2T0M",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 4,
    "text": "Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for you are with me.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:57:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-03T22:10:18Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2A4V2C8M1N7P0R6T3K9",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 5,
    "text": "You prepare a table before me in the presence of my enemies. You anoint my head with oil. My cup runs over.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T16:59:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-12T08:37:54Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2C0H6S2A9Q4W1D8V5R7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MFM2D7W0Q8P1S5N9B3H6R4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1FJ7C5N2W9D1S6A3Q8K0V",
    "chapter_number": 23,
    "verse_number": 6,
    "text": "Surely goodness and loving kindness shall follow me all the days of my life, and I will dwell in Yahweh’s house forever.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-01-06T17:00:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-21T09:02:12Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2E6P1M9D3H7K0V4R2T8",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KJ3R8D0N7C6W1H9M4X2L5",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1G2P8S4H6K0V2C9M1R7T",
    "chapter_number": 1,
    "verse_number": 1,
    "text": "In the beginning, God created the heavens and the earth.",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:14:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-05T03:18:58Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2H9C5W1R8T2A6H0V3K7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KJ3R8D0N7C6W1H9M4X2L5",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1G2P8S4H6K0V2C9M1R7T",
    "chapter_number": 1,
    "verse_number": 2,
    "text": "The earth was formless and empty. Darkness was on the surface of the deep and God’s Spirit was hovering over the surface of the waters.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:16:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-08T18:47:20Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2K2D8N6V1P9S3H5Q0R7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KJ3R8D0N7C6W1H9M4X2L5",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1G2P8S4H6K0V2C9M1R7T",
    "chapter_number": 1,
    "verse_number": 3,
    "text": "God said, “Let there be light,” and there was light.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:17:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-05T03:18:58Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2M5T9C2M8D0R6H3V7A1",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KJ3R8D0N7C6W1H9M4X2L5",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1G2P8S4H6K0V2C9M1R7T",
    "chapter_number": 1,
    "verse_number": 4,
    "text": "God saw the light, and saw that it was good. God divided the light from the darkness.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2024-12-02T11:19:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-29T12:22:06Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2P8V8P1K7M3D9H2R0T6",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KDF6N2A8J3W9H1Q7C5R0E4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F9N4V7C0M2D6S8H1Q5T",
    "chapter_number": 6,
    "verse_number": 8,
    "text": "But Noah found favor in Yahweh’s eyes.",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-03T07:40:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-01T17:33:29Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2S2R6A8W0C4H7V1P5D9M",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KDF6N2A8J3W9H1Q7C5R0E4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F9N4V7C0M2D6S8H1Q5T",
    "chapter_number": 6,
    "verse_number": 9,
    "text": "This is the history of Noah. Noah was a righteous man, blameless among the people of his time, and Noah walked with God.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-03T07:41:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-11T02:05:16Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2V6A3Q9T1V6C0M8R2K5",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0KDF6N2A8J3W9H1Q7C5R0E4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1F9N4V7C0M2D6S8H1Q5T",
    "chapter_number": 6,
    "verse_number": 10,
    "text": "Noah became the father of three sons: Shem, Ham, and Japheth.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-03T07:43:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-17T15:12:43Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T2Y1W6D2R8H9K3V0P7T4",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MP9C2N8V5M1T7W3H6D0Q4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1HD7A3Q9T1V6C0M8R2K5P",
    "chapter_number": 12,
    "verse_number": 1,
    "text": "Now Yahweh said to Abram, “Leave your country, and your relatives, and your father’s house, to the land that I will show you.”",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-03-12T20:08:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-24T04:51:03Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T30K0V6M2D8Q1H7R9A3S4",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MP9C2N8V5M1T7W3H6D0Q4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1HD7A3Q9T1V6C0M8R2K5P",
    "chapter_number": 12,
    "verse_number": 2,
    "text": "I will make of you a great nation. I will bless you and make your name great. You will be a blessing.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-03-12T20:10:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-16T13:09:47Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T33R6T2C8P1N9D4H0V5K7",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MP9C2N8V5M1T7W3H6D0Q4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1HD7A3Q9T1V6C0M8R2K5P",
    "chapter_number": 12,
    "verse_number": 3,
    "text": "I will bless those who bless you, and I will curse him who curses you. All the families of the earth will be blessed in you.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-03-12T20:12:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-24T04:51:03Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T36D6H2T9C4M7R0P8V3A9",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0N7C9M1D4Q8H6P2R5W0V3K",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1J1D6H2T9C4M7R0P8V3A",
    "chapter_number": 28,
    "verse_number": 19,
    "text": "Therefore go and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit,",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-04-07T08:06:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-02T18:26:31Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T39R9P1W6K2D8H0C7T4V6",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0N7C9M1D4Q8H6P2R5W0V3K",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1J1D6H2T9C4M7R0P8V3A",
    "chapter_number": 28,
    "verse_number": 20,
    "text": "teaching them to observe all things that I commanded you. Behold, I am with you always, even to the end of the age.",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-04-07T08:08:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-22T23:10:44Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3C9Q4C7N1V6H2M8D0R3T",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0NT2V9Q1H6R8C3M7D0W5A4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1J5R9P1W6K2D8H0C7T4V",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 23,
    "text": "For all have sinned and fall short of the glory of God;",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-26T12:31:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-09T01:57:08Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3F2M8S0H6K9D1R7T3P5V",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0NT2V9Q1H6R8C3M7D0W5A4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1J5R9P1W6K2D8H0C7T4V",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 24,
    "text": "being justified freely by his grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus;",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-02-26T12:33:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-11T09:19:28Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3H8V3Q1A6H9C2M7R0T5D",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0NT2V9Q1H6R8C3M7D0W5A4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1J5R9P1W6K2D8H0C7T4V",
    "chapter_number": 3,
    "verse_number": 25,
    "text": "whom God set forth to be an atoning sacrifice through faith in his blood, to show his righteousness, because of the passing over of prior sins,",
    "paragraph_break_before": false,
    "status": "disabled",
    "created_at": "2025-02-26T12:34:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-30T16:04:37Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3K7Y2C9V4Q6K1M8R3H5W",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MS6H1K3R8D0P9Q5N7A4V2",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1HW0V8R3A6Q2H9M1D7T5P",
    "chapter_number": 8,
    "verse_number": 28,
    "text": "We know that all things work together for good for those who love God, for those who are called according to his purpose.",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-03-01T05:45:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-23T12:08:02Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3N5D1S7N0B8T3P6A9J2E",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0MS6H1K3R8D0P9Q5N7A4V2",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1HW0V8R3A6Q2H9M1D7T5P",
    "chapter_number": 8,
    "verse_number": 31,
    "text": "What then shall we say about these things? If God is for us, who can be against us?",
    "paragraph_break_before": true,
    "status": "active",
    "created_at": "2025-03-01T05:48:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-27T20:13:12Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bvr_01J9T3Q2C7M1R9P6D4N8V0X5S",
    "translation_id": "btrn_01J2Z6Q6A1R6G9X0W6W5RZ3KJ9",
    "book_id": "bbook_01J5Y0NF1Q5V8C2R9D0M6H3K7T4",
    "chapter_id": "bchap_01J7X1GC9T4L6D0R2H8Q1V5W7P",
    "chapter_number": 5,
    "verse_number": 3,
    "text": "Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the Kingdom of Heaven.",
